37 events: headline 37/37, music 24/37, official min 95.07 / median 96.8 / max 99.79, B1 >= 90 on 34. Six events under their identity ceiling by more than 0.3 (five deterministic chains with ceiling 100, Opus E001 at 97.6 for 98.4): all above 99.9 seed-invariant; remaining error is the cell-exact STFT term (1.3 to 2.1 JND).

Null checks: (1) white noise with no relation to the reference, shared trim on 12 windows: critic 99.5 to 99.96 but official 0.06 to 79 (the critic cannot judge structure; the gate does not rest on it); lag-0 waveform correlation median 0.10, max 0.44. (2) cooked events: lag-0 correlation median 0.11 to 0.39 per member (chain alone 0.04 to 0.11), five low events at 0.75 to 0.98 (fitted oscillator left alone after the trim; 91 to 98 percent of the energy under 200 Hz).
